  "configuration_id": "config_003",
  "reason": "RNA-only results show that multiprofile scvi_n200 substantially outperforms single-profile scvi_n200 (0.653 vs 0.520 accuracy), while avgpool and transformer aggregation are nearly tied. The key uncertainty is whether this gain is mainly due to multiprofile processing or to the scvi representation. config_003 tests PCA under the same multiprofile/transformer setup as config_006, changing only the RNA encoder. This cleanly isolates the effect of representation and helps decide whether further effort should focus on RNA encoders, aggregation, or moving to image/multimodal models."
}

